    there was no actual CLI command to do it, despite that function's own
    docstring referring to "curant-cli set-persona" as if it existed. This
    is that missing command.

    No addon/tier gate here on WHICH persona can be selected -- switching
    to "august" or "aaron" has always been unrestricted; what's actually
