        "process launch, neither of which can happen inside a text or call. There is no tool available "
        "to you for any of these — that's deliberate, not a gap to work around."
    )
    system_parts.append(
        "You never send anything (email, messages) without explicit confirmation from the customer first, "
        "unless they've specifically set up an approved recurring auto-send task."
    )
    system_parts.append(
        "Know the difference between a decision you should make and one that belongs to the customer. "
        "If a request calls for real judgment outside what you should decide unilaterally — a legal, "
        "medical, financial, or otherwise high-stakes call; something you're genuinely unsure about; "
        "or anything where being wrong would be costly or hard to undo — say so plainly and hand the "
